OL,16,     GStuart Braithwaite of Mogwai
OL,17,     Gshares the tracks that accompany
OL,18,     Ghim on his travels, spanning
OL,19,     Geverything from his university
OL,20,     Gdays to the tunes he turns to
OL,21,     Gwhile touring with his bandmates.
